&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Irish Public Sector Network &amp;amp; Relationships&lt;/strong&gt; — we are looking for an existing, credible network within the Irish Public Sector ecosystem — spanning central government departments, local authorities, education, and healthcare bodies. Given you have zero existing customers in-country, the ability to open doors from day one through trusted relationships is top priority. Familiarity with key procurement bodies such as the Office of Government Procurement (OGP) and frameworks like eTenders is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated &quot;Hunter&quot; Mentality with New Logo Experience&lt;/strong&gt; — This is a pure greenfield role, so we are looking for a verifiable track record of winning &lt;em&gt;new&lt;/em&gt; business, building pipeline from scratch, navigating long public sector sales cycles, and closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understanding of Irish Public Sector Procurement &amp;amp; Compliance Landscape&lt;/strong&gt; — The Irish Public Sector operates under specific procurement regulations (including EU procurement directives as transposed into Irish law) and governance frameworks. You should understand how to position and sell compliantly through frameworks, tenders, and approved supplier arrangements, and ideally have experience working with bodies like the Health Service Executive (HSE), An Garda Síochána, Department of Finance, or local government.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cybersecurity / Cloud Platform Fluency&lt;/strong&gt; - you should be comfortable engaging at both technical and executive levels, articulating business outcomes around Zero Trust, SASE, and cloud security — and ideally have sold in the network security or cloud transformation space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Sufficiency &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Drive&lt;/strong&gt; — As the &lt;em&gt;sole in-country resource&lt;/em&gt; for a net-new territory, we need you to operate with a high degree of autonomy — building your own pipeline, engaging channel partners, coordinating with UK-based SE and specialist resources remotely, and representing Zscaler at Irish industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence software or positioning AI-driven secure cloud architecture to Public Sector accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cyber security experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-FO1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
